  "notes": [
    "ws_level3.jsonl is a companion capture, NOT an importer input (SPEC 5.7.1 lists executions only). Both L3 deletes look identical ('delete: ... i.e. full fill or cancel'); only executions say G filled and H was cancelled. Use it to test that an L3-based path (e.g. a future Kraken L3 ingest or a mirror/real-order extractor) does not label deletes as fills.",
    "L3 per-order timestamp is the insert/amend time ('The time the order was inserted or amended'), so the delete rows carry the ADD time, not the removal time; L3 alone cannot time the fill or cancel.",
    "L3 timestamps have 9 fractional digits; executions have 6 (us).",
    "fees [{asset USD, qty 0.0}] -> fee 0.0 (not null)."
